cbsheet 1

# The uppercut, on the ground, 4 s apart: whoever is ahead (3 m) is launched up, and you hop.

# Its names (the brawl mod's C++ finds them).
event brawl.uppercut.started
event brawl.uppercut.hit
param inventory.start 1
# How it meets the other skills: its tag, and what it waits out (the guard's tag, the telekinesis's status).
tag attack
tag guard
status pulled

motion Rise on use if not linked and grounded
	tags attack
	blocked by guard, pulled
	until brawl.uppercut.used or pressed.jump
	cooldown 4 s
	lasts 0.05 s
	emit brawl.uppercut.started
	cast ray range 3 m along facing
		emit brawl.uppercut.hit
		impulse 12 m/s along up replace vertical
		impulse 6 m/s on self along up replace vertical
